      "text": "Yeah, I’ve kind of tried to do that with the color coding… Where I use the SAT recommended episode reddish color alongside the blue green consciousness color in the same thumbnail. I haven’t gotten that entirely consistent or implemented yet though. I have to listen to all the episodes to decide what exactly constitutes what kind of content and  really  solidify the iconography and color coding",
